<t id="1067" p="193.17 7.50" Justification="Center" CaptionJustification="Center" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="96">NaH (1.2 equiv),&#10;MeI, DMF,&#10;0 °C to rt</s></t>
<t id="1068" p="276.15 43.50" Justification="Center" CaptionJustification="Center" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="16.00" face="0">?</s></t>
<t id="1069" p="0.00 105.10" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="0">Q: What is the product? Say what hazard you would warn a colleague about before running this. [5]</s></t>
<t id="1070" p="0.00 124.10" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="0">Answer</s></t>
<t id="1071" p="0.00 250.32" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="0">Hazard: sodium hydride, NaH, DMF, runaway, exotherm, thermal, decomposition</s></t>
